# Per-PR review-loop evidence: snapshots, loop position, dispatch logs and
# exit files. Ephemeral by contract -- a fresh container legitimately has
# none, and re-dispatching is the documented remedy. Mirrors the pattern
# .agents/captures/.gitignore uses for the same reason.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS SEPARATELY (Codex-adjacent, #91 round 1): the
# contract states .agents/reviews/ is gitignored, and plan-review.mjs writes
# an ignore file for the plan-loop directories it creates. A CODE review
# loop never runs that script, so .agents/reviews/pr-<n>/ was covered by
# nothing and a git add -A would have committed a snapshot of the PR body.
*
!.gitignore
